      <Docs>
        <summary>Compress to the WEBP lossless format.</summary>
        <value>The selection that requests lossless WebP encoding.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Compress to the WEBP lossless format. quality refers to how much effort to put into compression. A value of 0 means to compress quickly, resulting in a relatively large file size. 100 means to spend more time compressing, resulting in a smaller file.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/Bitmap.CompressFormat#WEBP_LOSSLESS" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.Bitmap.CompressFormat.WEBP_LOSSLESS</code>.</a></format></para>
